  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "How "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "exciting"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " it is to travel around the world by bike!"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "骑自行车环游世界，这是多么令人兴奋啊！"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "excited 和 exciting 都是与 excite 相关的形容词，但它们的含义和用法有一定区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "excited"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 表示“感到兴奋的；激动的”，通常用来修饰人，或与人的感受、表情、行为等相关的名词，如 voice, face 等，强调人自身因为某件事或物而产生兴奋、激动的情绪；也可作表语，说明主语的状态。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：The "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "excited"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " children opened their Christmas presents."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "兴奋的孩子们打开了他们的圣诞礼物。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "He was "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "excited"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " about the upcoming trip. 他对即将到来的旅行感到兴奋。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "exciting"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 表示“令人兴奋的；使人激动的”，主要用于修饰事物，说明该事物具有能够引起他人兴奋、激动的特性；可作定语放在名词前，或作表语说明主语的性质。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：The football game was really "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "exciting"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". 这场足球比赛真的很令人兴奋。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "It’s an "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "exciting"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " opportunity for her. 对她来说，这是一个令人兴奋的机会。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
